Factories, drills, and shipment departures use this colony battery and generation. Do not call RequestResource for colony power. Do not add stock panel output into this balance. This ensures one owner computes loaded and unloaded power and avoids competing background resource simulators.

Building options: baseline basic battery bank adds 2000 capacity and costs 60 Metal with no Parts or campaign requirement; advanced battery bank adds 8000 capacity and uses the c03 blueprint and section 17 recipe; solar array rated 40 units/s at Kerbin's solar distance; generator upgrade raises starter output to 40 units/s; advanced generator produces 120 units/s. Continuous generators are abstract industrial utilities maintained by the defined Supplies/service system, not delivered fuel. There is no ongoing operating-funds charge, fuel subscription or recurring billing system. Only explicit emergency service visits incur service funds. No perpetual claim about real reactor fuel is needed.

